 remotely as effective as working in shared office.\nVisit our website: https://sync.vive.com/ to book your meeting.", "short_description": "VIVE Sync serves as a secure and flexible space where business professionals can discuss, collaborate, and share ideas seamlessly regardless of time and locations.  A custom avatar solution coupled with a full body avatar simulation, a virtual 3D environment, and many more features makes working remotely as effective as working in shared office.\nVisit our website: https://sync.vive.com/ to book your meeting."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "512X512.png", "id": "1622642418124115", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75324644_1622642421457448_1401999114815811647_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dP_hLXIHRLIQ7kNvwHAsPT3&_nc_oc=Ado7dBPic3WLvJlfaJ_zEnsh911Toe3N2sGUVXae1fA3hiZaz4taxaV6NYeXofusT_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0O2Ltd6wXbVO6jGllsBXZUdqc8idGCa66MEqAiCrgbZQ&oe=69F1F930"}, {"file_name": "1440X1440.png", "id": "750164942158873", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75367586_750164945492206_3106902419253218692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vA9p3wd0JwoQ7kNvwEZU37J&_nc_oc=Adq09Vj-iKOId1bf5rHd9O2NRG5bXk9bJRFDV6ZaXSKPA55VxRofNteXv_EUX92_RD4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1KzcqvIylVPvBvCJ-rNR9IF-iDVwgMptzHk8Q2F5FrQw&oe=69F203C8"}, {"file_name": "1080X360.png", "id": "469811201118875", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035379_469811204452208_426304332967697919_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=loBJnOYPj0YQ7kNvwGJ6ISd&_nc_oc=AdpDrWy3NKYinAE7p8bCjm8sKMqUkpzQ-7HbEWm4Rzl2x4GxPiLwOGcn5hTRrAuYi44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af064BCtLZVH96WrD8zGXBI-E65OoFd6JdLx340UDxGP_Q&oe=69F20FF0"}, {"file_name": "1008